\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Shared representation and paired harmonization in HCE. The upper part shows the bi-temporal shared CNN--FPN, DINO semantic fusion, and \(P1\)--\(P5\) paths; the lower part details paired statistical calibration and local soft alignment. \(A/B\) denote pre-event/post-event inputs; \(Q\) comes from post-event features and sampled \(K/V\) from pre-event features. Local alignment updates the pre-event branch.}}{12}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:encoder_ha}{{3}{12}{Shared representation and paired harmonization in HCE. The upper part shows the bi-temporal shared CNN--FPN, DINO semantic fusion, and \(P1\)--\(P5\) paths; the lower part details paired statistical calibration and local soft alignment. \(A/B\) denote pre-event/post-event inputs; \(Q\) comes from post-event features and sampled \(K/V\) from pre-event features. Local alignment updates the pre-event branch}{figure.caption.4}{}}
